* LaTeX
Adding explicit instruction to use latexmk -pdf in order to allow embedded images in an org document to be converted to a pdf
#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(with-eval-after-load 'org
  (setq org-latex-pdf-process
        '("latexmk -pdf -interaction=nonstopmode -output-directory=%o %f")))
#+end_src


